  "notable_quotes": [
    "CPF-13 is a permanently microporous material with a type I isotherm, 1008 m2/g Langmuir area, 642 m2/g BET area, and 0.350 cm3/g micropore volume.",
    "CPF-13 shows high H2 uptake plus high CO2/N2 and CO2/CH4 selectivity, indicating strong gas sorption and separation performance.",
    "The framework remains stable after solvent removal up to about 300 °C, with only guest loss observed from 40 to 220 °C in TGA."
